OL,3,GNEWSAOutdoor centre closure options to
OL,4,Abe reviewed
OL,5,
OL,6,FOptions to save an outdoor education
OL,7,Fcentre earmarked for closure will be
OL,8,Fassessed in a review.
OL,10,FHigh Borrans in Windermere, Cumbria, is
OL,11,Fdue to be shut down by its owner North
OL,12,FTyneside Council in November.
OL,14,FThe decision sparked a public and
OL,15,Fpolitical backlash, but local authority
OL,16,Fbosses said a multimillion-pound repair
OL,17,Fbill and declining school visits had
OL,18,Fmade the centre unviable.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
