OL,3,GNEWSAOutdoor centre closure options to
OL,4,Abe reviewed
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has now been announced the Institute
OL,7,Ffor Outdoor Learning is heading a
OL,8,Fworking group to explore whether High
OL,9,FBorrans can have a future outside
OL,10,Fcouncil ownership.
